{% comment %}
  A butterfly emoji that wanders across the viewport, flapping as it goes.

  The emoji is a single glyph, so its wings cannot be animated directly. It is
  drawn twice instead: one copy clipped to its left half, one to its right.
  Both fold toward the shared centre line, which is where the body sits, so
  the wings beat while the body stays put.

  Motion: assets/js/butterfly.js. Styles: _sass/_butterfly.scss.
  Toggle with `enable_butterfly` in _config.yml.
{% endcomment %}
{% if site.enable_butterfly %}
  <div id="butterfly" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="bf-wing bf-wing--left">🦋</span>
    <span class="bf-wing bf-wing--right">🦋</span>
  </div>
{% endif %}
